# (build 160) The rumble on a damage floor (loc_7108): Gaira, from the
# open cell above the floor (damage_floor_field's way). The bite is felt
# with its white field and SXFID_DangerousFloor, a buzz; the point of HP
# it takes off everyone standing, eight fields on, is the same bite and not
# felt again. Eighteen more bites up and down (map_wipeout's walk, build
# 157c), and the last point leaves Rolf at 0: he falls ("ROLF is dead!"),
# then the game over.

start level $41 3 5
party 1 1
rumble-log motors.txt 3
wait idle
walk down 2                  # onto 3,7: the white field is this tick
expect rumble floor 1
expect rumble going
expect stat 0 hp 19          # loc_7162 comes after the fields
wait ticks 8
expect stat 0 hp 18
expect rumble hurt 0         # the point is the bite's, felt already
wait ticks 6                 # (build 161) the buzz's 8 + 6
expect rumble still
wait idle
walk up 1
wait idle
walk down 1
wait idle
walk up 1
wait idle
walk down 1
wait idle
walk up 1
wait idle
walk down 1
wait idle
walk up 1
wait idle
walk down 1
wait idle
walk up 1
wait idle
walk down 1
wait idle
walk up 1
wait idle
walk down 1
wait idle
walk up 1
wait idle
walk down 1
wait idle
walk up 1
wait idle
walk down 1
wait idle
walk up 1
wait idle
walk down 1
wait idle
expect script $1721          # "ROLF is dead!"
expect rumble floor 18
expect rumble hurt 0
expect rumble fell 1
expect stat 0 hp 0
press c
wait screen gameover
expect rumble lost 1
